# 🤖 8005: AI Model Registry & Rotation (L8)

## 1. Key Vault Location
All AI keys for cloud providers are centralised at:
`C:\GitHub\T1-vrvish-core\theHive\.env`

**Mandate:** Apps and agents MUST read upward to this central vault for cloud API keys.

## 2. Technical Source of Truth
The definitive, machine-readable registry of available AI models and their tiers is the `MODEL_CONFIG` dictionary within the master provider engine:
- **Engine Path:** `C:\GitHub\T1-vrvish-core\scripts\T0-Core\engines\Engine_ModelProvider.py`

The `Agent_Launcher.py` uses this configuration as its single source of truth to provision models for the swarm.

## 3. Strategic Model Tiers (Human Readable)
